<title>PHILIPPINES: Jardine Davies Q1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Jardine Davies Q1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   5.42 vs 0.35</p>
<p>    Turnover			612.386 vs 569.402</p>
<p>    Net income		    237.978 vs 8.035</p>
<p>Note: Full name Jardine Davies Inc. Jardine said the 1997 net income includes a non-recurring item worth 227.51 million pesos.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
